---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_timing --> q_check_target: hasEnded AND refundPeriodExpired
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period active
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_target --> q_transfer_pos: target has no existing position
    q_check_target --> q_revert_exists: target already has position
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionExists
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_old: copy position to newAddress
    q_clear_old --> [*]: clear old position, emit PositionTransferred

    note right of q_transfer_pos
        INV-001: only after refund period expiration
        INV-002: no position merge - target must be empty
    end note
